    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Alumna, Rahina Muaza - 2012, has been awarded The  Fritz-Steppat-Prize 2020   by the  Association for the Advancement of the ZMO e.V. , for her PhD dissertation \"Qur´an Recitation and the Nudity of the Female Voice in Nigeria\". The prize is awarded for an outstanding scientific text by a young researcher who has been supervised by a member of the Association for the Advancement of the ZMO.",
